<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 02:44:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-201</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的嘴里也有金属味吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;文章&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-201"&gt;《地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-201</guid></item><item><title>红海海上安全特遣部队指挥官谈到护航请求大幅增加（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/red-sea-maritime-security-task-force-commander-talks-major-jump-in-escort-requests</link><description>&lt;p&gt;胡塞武装开始袭击沙特油轮后，红海航运面临的危险再次增加。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/red-sea-maritime-security-task-force-commander-talks-major-jump-in-escort-requests"&gt;红海海上安全特遣部队指挥官谈论护航请求的重大跳跃（更新）&lt;/a&gt;后首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 20:56:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/red-sea-maritime-security-task-force-commander-talks-major-jump-in-escort-requests</guid></item><item><title>美国海军正在寻求潜射防空导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/u-s-navy-is-seeking-a-submarine-launched-anti-air-missile</link><description>&lt;p&gt;海军计划建立革命性的模块化地对空导弹库，并计划增加潜艇作为发射平台。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/u-s-navy-is-seeking-a-submarine-launched-anti-air-missile"&gt;美国海军正在寻求潜射防空导弹的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:50:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/u-s-navy-is-seeking-a-submarine-launched-anti-air-missile</guid></item><item><title>F-35B 在米拉玛海军陆战队航空站坠毁并烧毁（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/f-35b-crashes-and-burns-at-marine-corps-air-station-miramar</link><description>&lt;p&gt;当地时间上午 10 点左右，这架 F-35B 在庞大的海军陆战队基地跑道尽头附近坠毁。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/f-35b-crashes-and-burns-at-marine-corps-air-station-miramar"&gt;F-35B 在米拉马尔海军陆战队航空站坠毁并烧毁后（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:47:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/f-35b-crashes-and-burns-at-marine-corps-air-station-miramar</guid></item><item><title>土耳其最新的卡恩战斗机原型开始出租车测试</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/turkeys-latest-kaan-fighter-prototype-begins-taxi-tests</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着土耳其航空航天公司推出多种飞行原型机，P1 飞机开始进行动力滑行测试。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/turkeys-latest-kaan-fighter-prototype-begins-taxi-tests"&gt;土耳其最新的卡恩战斗机原型机开始滑行测试的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 17:59:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/turkeys-latest-kaan-fighter-prototype-begins-taxi-tests</guid></item><item><title>F-15E 在怀特曼空军基地取代 A-10 标志着鹰舰队进行更大规模的重组</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet</link><description>&lt;p&gt;将“攻击鹰”转移到预备役的一项令人惊讶的计划可能预示着如何分配更大的 F-15EX 机队。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet"&gt;怀特曼空军基地的 F-15E 取代 A-10 后，标志着鹰舰队进行更大的调整，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:40:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet</guid></item><item><title>无人机袭击地中海埃及港口引发担忧伊朗冲突将扩大（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen</link><description>&lt;p&gt;关于谁击中了远离冲突地区的天然气油轮的说法众说纷纭，但这似乎是为了传递一个信息。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen"&gt;无人机袭击地中海埃及港口引发担忧伊朗冲突将扩大（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:36:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen</guid></item><item><title>日本F-2战斗机现身 翼下新型大型隐形巡航导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings</link><description>&lt;p&gt;此前未曾见过的导弹可能是空射型 25 型导弹，它极大地扩大了 F-2 的防区外打击范围。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings"&gt;日本F-2战斗机机翼下新型大型隐形巡航导弹亮相后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 19:38:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings</guid></item><item><title>日本正式加入战斧巡航导弹俱乐部</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日本从其一艘驱逐舰上发射了第一枚战斧导弹，开创了远程巡航导弹能力的新时代。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club"&gt;日本已正式加入战斧巡航导弹俱乐部的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:45:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club</guid></item><item><title>中国驱逐舰与美国无人机船的遭遇凸显了未来交战规则问题</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着小型无人水面舰艇的激增，它们潜在构成的威胁将会增加，交战规则也必须适应。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues"&gt;中国驱逐舰与美国无人机船的相遇凸显了未来交战规则问题的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:11:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues</guid></item></channel></rss>